{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/nw9yba44vmkad74hvuab878t1wynur4.mp3","text":"早安，博士。我可以画一幅您的肖像画吗？啊，我会注意不让它实体化的。而且，也不是什么都能实体化的啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/6f9564lmulp2dkqdrxkh4do5pryo2je.mp3","text":"我出现在这里，似乎有些唐突吧...","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/475sy7qa5ee8a1fd7kuoxgpenqgj9ot.mp3","text":"博士，我的瞳孔里倒映着的你，到底是什么颜色呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/ccp9t8emz2vgkseytmwhkbp3mpdgihn.mp3","text":"罗德岛有很多有趣的创作素材啊，灵感，渐渐涌出来了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/b422fgwpy8b418rihhne0boxnuqbv6k.mp3","text":"看到我可爱的“助手”们了吗？你觉得它们有点可怕？明明很可爱的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/bw8ou60zkeomjrnz4iy7ibem4gz6d02.mp3","text":"呵呵，这就是你的颜色吗——凝视我吧，让我染上更多属于你的颜色。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/4niflyfizwjvo7azox1q39s8hxf0r1o.mp3","text":"嗯，没错，就算谁也不理解我，我也会这样继续画下去。无论它们会变成什么样的怪物......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/0w4upntaxaew4lk4ikl6pp7ngj6vme6.mp3","text":"我们创作者是什么样的人呢，每个月都有三十天以上的瓶颈期，觉得自己怎么画都画不好，而且只有深夜才有效率......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ppfdhy1199pka1nwd8r9ua7cdovatq8.mp3","text":"斑驳世界终在它幽暗腹中安然长眠......没错，那是深海真正的颜色。只看得到黑色吗？看来，我还没能将一切都与你分享呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/pfntdk05fqe0omltv1lm8utydnsfm66.mp3","text":"是在......做梦吗？你那梦中的颜色——是否也像世间万物般绚烂呢，博士......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/806jlds81xxa5hpa896k85gns5gsqlh.mp3","text":"请叫我“深海色”。我的职业是画家，对，只是一个“画家”哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/j0sy1nz9ljsfleude8nh0s8me41jj9b.mp3","text":"这种不安的感觉是......?","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/ss634onloopahg8dtsd9vg5nu9neq9i.mp3","text":"呃，别再这么关心我的事了。如果再这样亲切对待我的话，我，我不知道自己会变成什么样子......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/81xp56pyid096i7a79fhfhwqbdxo7r7.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士，现在，让我们完成这幅作品吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/4xeua25hdz6gl8k8j98p71mxjjohln6.mp3","text":"真的要我上战场吗？不会吧？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/gzsktoek81wis74ydw6q8ypfvencil4.mp3","text":"我没法领导这么多人啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/2yex8egu4xfqj9tiw2co90mvv532bum.mp3","text":"大家要加油哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/lsxfrysa2ojulsdfjseqt07se4ydbb7.mp3","text":"那就是敌人么！？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/qfl1r4myn7pjr1mxswvk7qr6crbwfi3.mp3","text":"我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/fnima4q2k8xs60ay219zcd3f011335n.mp3","text":"我该怎么办？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/l4a6v1zr7hwjyzzi3ebmmw49sn3ubkb.mp3","text":"涂涂抹抹~","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/aqrqpisndcb8lbqls9vghsvoibfkl3z.mp3","text":"唉唉唉，等一下啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/iwsrdtb0inv0y5m5ro4secwr717ztxp.mp3","text":"别着急。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/32/m8axc7tvzf3l58jxbw31i3y2pd85oau.mp3","text":"慢慢来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/sgtymh66ukab2movvh8c00rbeqvdzu4.mp3","text":"和我的“助手”们过两招吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/72gmk1q976kmt1k9f4lvmnrw1ruinf2.mp3","text":"这些孩子，你赢得了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/5j2x2i3oz1r1wpqr7ckf9yiho1g34wy.mp3","text":"如果真的惹恼了我，可不知道会有什么事情发生哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/i4eafz6dtbhv62568ri2yt4g602jis7.mp3","text":"大家胜利的英姿，就让我画下来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/d3t1jmsa6b98klairmsehjqivjlyy24.mp3","text":"啊，衣服又弄脏了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/jt1to3ozwm1fzgmdl6n6izl91l90lyf.mp3","text":"要是作战的结果，也能像画作一样重新涂改就好了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/e6i1mn9ehq1lwu6npkl9kdoqpjyk5gl.mp3","text":"这个房间的设计很好看啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/q3lib38l8xkf4apm9an6aczvjn0k5d8.mp3","text":"嗯嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/38i51apuoq42d2ktaihx3tzyd3mf8e3.mp3","text":"博士，难得有时间休息，要来看看我最新的作品吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/3bramjpjujqp178ypr4zx4rcj5o2dda.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/4r4dv7517fcay5nz1ekm2p5w46wq4rj.mp3","text":"新年好，博士。博士问新年在我眼中是什么颜色的吗？嗯......食物的香气、干员们的笑脸、饱含着心意的礼物......温暖的、柔软的姜黄？很新奇的感受呢，让我把这一切都画下来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/4a3anczcwrt924m0pq130rn0xycehvb.mp3","text":"早上好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_110_deepcl/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/itoe0bi66bojpsebuvllz4258n8w8qz.mp3","text":"早安，博士。我可以画一幅您的肖像画吗？啊，我会注意不让它实体化的。而且，也不是什么都能实体化的啦。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/nmgsc03zm4pvxs216euudoutvsu4syf.mp3","text":"我出现在这里，似乎有些唐突吧...","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/o64z9narrp6p48lgx2k8afj79s95lw8.mp3","text":"博士，我的瞳孔里倒映着的你，到底是什么颜色呢。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/igvq7cl23mvxmnkfyjt93kimr6gwb9g.mp3","text":"罗德岛有很多有趣的创作素材啊，灵感，渐渐涌出来了呢。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/qs3fa9ikmug4vuottu7cmvy1mfcjbmr.mp3","text":"看到我可爱的“助手”们了吗？你觉得它们有点可怕？明明很可爱的！","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/fwyuk3qxviwemaqozs62cvg1jtpfocx.mp3","text":"呵呵，这就是你的颜色吗——凝视我吧，让我染上更多属于你的颜色。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/1waktp39tyznaxvdguxbxoc6b4r0ftz.mp3","text":"嗯，没错，就算谁也不理解我，我也会这样继续画下去。无论它们会变成什么样的怪物......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/5u6uzgc3pvytvuysa7yvz1t8e0kj85r.mp3","text":"我们创作者是什么样的人呢，每个月都有三十天以上的瓶颈期，觉得自己怎么画都画不好，而且只有深夜才有效率......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/oaszllj6iisy37a3wlakm6q6xztszg2.mp3","text":"斑驳世界终在它幽暗腹中安然长眠......没错，那是深海真正的颜色。只看得到黑色吗？看来，我还没能将一切都与你分享呢。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/8r82aif2zr6fg4f32k2c08e5t2b5fpn.mp3","text":"是在......做梦吗？你那梦中的颜色——是否也像世间万物般绚烂呢，博士......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/n04486sja05edtkdddoodusm6d1n9ty.mp3","text":"请叫我“深海色”。我的职业是画家，对，只是一个“画家”哦。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/nmkjkerbxbwrit3uj8pou0kpperb3sj.mp3","text":"这种不安的感觉是......?","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/kf1wvntse1av3al78cje17uzuwjqf5e.mp3","text":"呃，别再这么关心我的事了。如果再这样亲切对待我的话，我，我不知道自己会变成什么样子......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/lt498j6t0oirir4wg8sootbsejcx7qx.mp3","text":"谢谢你，博士，现在，让我们完成这幅作品吧？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/np9dnqxnxeumw3q4kce4cey4ihguvyv.mp3","text":"真的要我上战场吗？不会吧？！","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/d8j26trahiqglj7vsff7oqkbu0wb1ui.mp3","text":"我没法领导这么多人啦。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/l7ltxryiqzaq4qxhxlz3uhdrdgr2305.mp3","text":"大家要加油哦！","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/6dwioaihfii3ao4svbw9efpmukx8qf5.mp3","text":"那就是敌人么！？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/qn543jyg03ay84d10ezjvned34e7sst.mp3","text":"我吗？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/71/aklkxmnxndlzdmgi8sv3f0t43ph2s2j.mp3","text":"我该怎么办？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/rr4if5voj26wwkwoqe30lcdnkdtgy9z.mp3","text":"涂涂抹抹~","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/4ew152ckjvuuxiaah58u9gdfqdwgp91.mp3","text":"唉唉唉，等一下啦！","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/9doh2xyw4q3fvgp2zwhbqciil8kd0cu.mp3","text":"别着急。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/stn9m03fe6gdpjtmvvmljhhncsp5fbb.mp3","text":"慢慢来吧。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/boxe2fn3logxkqcnbm1szkcu52jus1b.mp3","text":"和我的“助手”们过两招吧。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/l26204qdvimw7s4ohz7gh221vvigkhd.mp3","text":"这些孩子，你赢得了吗？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/2zpis347xut8xzqb1xagv9pgwu8wfly.mp3","text":"如果真的惹恼了我，可不知道会有什么事情发生哦。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/8hz04w341914c5eouz7ig87w7snu6wc.mp3","text":"大家胜利的英姿，就让我画下来吧。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/fxcd6wihr7x7ckwqvdfnczua8uvi4ya.mp3","text":"啊，衣服又弄脏了......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/keowo090ofu03ew9esk76tr3y5jo82s.mp3","text":"要是作战的结果，也能像画作一样重新涂改就好了......","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/k8575grg06a6pcsy864rozeci79cqb5.mp3","text":"这个房间的设计很好看啊。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/98y9zuvmwyfgaktu7tz8jz43zflje08.mp3","text":"嗯嗯？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/dvy49i9f5wpthduu7grxwd06ktre5ti.mp3","text":"博士，难得有时间休息，要来看看我最新的作品吗？","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/74rsuwcyznlmluyy33bj4xpdjr9jvua.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/nof438w341m8e5u94jctseie4k6rss1.mp3","text":"新年好，博士。博士问新年在我眼中是什么颜色的吗？嗯......食物的香气、干员们的笑脸、饱含着心意的礼物......温暖的、柔软的姜黄？很新奇的感受呢，让我把这一切都画下来吧。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/3e851xkwd50cz4ovwzbuc35i15co4g1.mp3","text":"早上好，博士。","alt":"voice/char_110_deepcl/cn_042.mp3"}]}}